{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"群的外自同构"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"群的外自同构"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>定义 $n$-截断"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":" $G$ 的 $n$-截断<strong>外自同构群</strong> (outer automorphism group) 为其"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}G$ 作为"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"的自同构群的 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Out}_{\\leq n}(G)&amp;:=\r\n\\tau_{\\leq n}\r\n(\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Grp}}(G) /_{\\mathrm{Ad}} G)\\\\\r\n&amp; =\\tau_{\\leq n}\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>. 两个群的"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环路空间"}},{"Plain":"之间 (作为<strong>不带点</strong>生象) 的映射空间满足\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(\\mathbf{B}G,\\mathbf{B}H)\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Grp}(\\mathsf{Ani})}(G,H)/_{\\mathrm{Ad}} H,\r\n$$\n即群同态的生象关于 $H$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"共轭作用","text":"共轭作用"}},{"Plain":"的商.</p>\n<h3>离散群</h3>\n<p>考虑 $G$ 为离散群 ($0$-截断群) 的情形.</p>\n<p>考虑群 $G$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"群的外自同构","text":"外自同构"}},{"Plain":"群\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Out}(G)&amp;=\r\n\\tau_{\\leq 0}\r\n(\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Grp}}(G) /_{\\mathrm{Ad}} G)\\\\\r\n&amp; =\\tau_{\\leq 0}\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n一个生象 $A$ 在某点处的连通分支是 $A\\to\\tau_{\\leq 0} A$ 在该点的"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维"}},{"Plain":". 由"},{"Local":{"url":"中心","text":"中心"}},{"Plain":" $Z(G)$ 的定义, $\\mathbf{B}Z(G)$ 是 $\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G)$ 在 $\\mathrm{id}$ 处的连通分支. 那么有"},{"Local":{"url":"群短正合列","text":"短正合列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathbf{B}Z(G) \\to \\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G) \\to \\operatorname{Out}(G)\r\n$$\n以及"},{"Local":{"url":"纤维列","text":"纤维列"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\mathbf{B}Z(G) &amp;\\to \\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G) \\to \\operatorname{Out}(G)\\\\\r\n\\to \\mathbf{B}^2Z(G) &amp;\\to \\mathbf{B}\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G) \\to \\mathbf{B}\\operatorname{Out}(G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"内自同构","text":"内自同构"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}